note contract 5 layout line 159: the field index is checked like an array index; a run-time index 64
note into buf (COUNT 64) traps 3: exit 103, no stdout.
om2
layout shactx 104
field state uint 8 at 0 little
field count ulong at 32 little
field buf uchar 64 at 40 little
end
fn poke c edit shactx k ulong to void
put c buf k 1
end
fn main to int
c = new uchar 104 0
poke c 64
w = write 1 c 0 104
ret 0
end
